1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
十年前，这里只喝茶
Ten years ago, this city only drank tea

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
今天，年轻人排队买咖啡
Today, the young queue for coffee

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
中国人为什么突然爱上它？
Why did China suddenly fall for it?

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
喝咖啡的，多是二十到四十岁
Most drinkers are aged 25 to 44

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
一半以上的都市白领，每周都喝
Over half of urban millennials drink it weekly

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
人均一年，从半杯到两杯多
Per person: from half a cup to over two, a week

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,500
增长速度，是全球的十倍
Growing ten times faster than the world

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,500
但他们买的，不只是咖啡因
But they're not just buying caffeine

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,500
城里的房子小，人心却要透气
City flats are small; the mind needs air

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,500
咖啡馆，成了家和公司之外的第三个家
The café becomes a third home

11
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,000
在这里办公，见朋友，发呆
A place to work, to meet, to drift

12
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:54,000
一杯咖啡，买一段慢下来的时间
One cup buys a slower hour

13
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,500
竞争太快，这里可以喘口气
The race is fast; here you catch your breath

14
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,500
偷得浮生半日闲
"Stealing from life half a day's ease"

15
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,000
从速溶，到一条街十家手冲
From instant, to ten cafés on one street

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,500
咖啡，长成了一种生活方式
Coffee grew into a way of living

17
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:20,000
它不再洋气，它只是日常
No longer foreign — just daily life

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,500
黄昏的窗边，热气还在升
By the dusk window, the steam still rises

19
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,500
一座城，正在慢慢学会停下来
A city, slowly learning to pause

20
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:36,000
你的城市，第几波咖啡浪潮了？
Which coffee wave is your city on?

21
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,500
关注，带你走进下一座城
Follow — into the next city
